    - h: Set the scope
      p: Decide whether a role sees all records, only the ones assigned to the user, or the ones managed by the user and their team.
      path: ["All", "Assigned", "Managed"]
    - h: Lock the stages
      p: A delivery stage that is assigned to someone can be edited by that person. Others read it, unless they hold an override permission.
